ht the Shrines is a deck-building game in which you collect a variety of cards, create your own powerful deck, and engage in strategic battles to restore light to shrines shrouded in darkness.🔗 Learn More and Play the Demo:🎥 The Cardian - Light the Shrin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T01:00:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927946","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838650-1845383656396405","game_id":"steam-4838650","kind":"announcement","title":"The Cardian - Light the Shrines Steam Demo Launches on October 8 UTC! 🛡️🃏","summary":"Hello, Voyagers!We’re thrilled to announce that the The Cardian - Light the Shrines Steam demo will launch on October 8!Get ready to plan your actions with cards and defend the shrines against waves of incoming enemies.🃏 About The Cardian - Light the ShrinesThe Cardian - Light the Shrines is a defensive roguelike in which you become a guardian of the shrines. Use cards to move, defeat enemies, and strengthen your deck and strategy as you progress.The demo offers approximately 30 minutes to one h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T13:19:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396405","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838650-1845383656396142","game_id":"steam-4838650","kind":"announcement","title":"The Cardian - Light the Shrines Is Coming to Steam Next Fest! ⚔️","summary":"Hello, Voyagers! 🫡The Cardian - Light the Shrines is joining Steam Next Fest!Experience the demo for The Cardian - Light the Shrines for the first time during Steam Next Fest. Anticipate enemy movements, plan your route and card sequence, and defend the last Shrines of Light from the forces of the Black Mist.The Cardian - Light the Shrines Steam Next Fest Trailer🌟 More OFFMOON Games at Steam Next FestThe Cardian - Light the Shrines isn’t the only OFFMOON title joining Steam Next Fest!Visit the O","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T11:46:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396142","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838650-1844751498217843","game_id":"steam-4838650","kind":"announcement","title":"Introducing The Cardian - Light the Shrines!","summary":"Salute to all Voyagers! 🫡We’re excited to introduce our upcoming title, The Cardian - Light the Shrines! 🃏✨The Cardian - Light the Shrines is a tactical roguelike deckbuilding card-defense game where positioning is everything. Predict enemy movements, plan your path, and set your cards in advance to defend the last Shrines of Light!The game will also be participating in Steam Next Fest this October, so get ready to experience the battle for yourself!📅 Planned Release Date: December 8, 2026🎮 Wish","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T09:17:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4838650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:32:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:32:07Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4838650":"2026-10-26T14:32:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4838650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:32:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:32:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:32:07Z"},"5268660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:32: